2026-07-27T11:21:17.4430241Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:21:17.4430855Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:21:17.4431395Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:21:17.4432245Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:21:17.4433791Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:21:17.4435373Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
